1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:04,190
(Raj:)Oh, my God, Kenny G.

2
00:00:04,356 --> 00:00:07,446
(Raj:)This woman can read me like a book.

3
00:00:08,318 --> 00:00:12,408
(Raj:)I can't believe I bought my soul mate
at Glendale Galleria.

4
00:00:17,202 --> 00:00:19,992
I don't know if I wanna stay.

5
00:00:30,090 --> 00:00:33,550
(Penny:)This is amazing.
How did you even get this idea?

6
00:00:33,719 --> 00:00:37,349
I called your dad. I asked what things
you liked to do when you were a kid.

7
00:00:37,848 --> 00:00:41,728
(Leonard:)This seemed easier than getting a cow
out here so you could tip it.

8
00:00:43,854 --> 00:00:46,444
(Penny:)Okay, you're kind of really great.

9
00:00:46,606 --> 00:00:48,356
(Leonard:)For a person whose neck massages...

10
00:00:48,525 --> 00:00:52,115
(Leonard:)...feel like an eagle
is trying to carry you to its nest?

11
00:00:53,196 --> 00:00:56,286
Bug report. I complimented you.
You should take it and shut up.

